OL,3,AStorm Boelo expected to bring more
OL,4,Adisruption as hundreds still hit by
OL,5,AAusten power cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is expected to bring wet
OL,8,Fand windy weather across large swathes
OL,9,Fof the country on Saturday, with
OL,10,FScotland being hit the hardest
OL,12,FYellow and amber warnings have been
OL,13,Fgiven for Scotland, northern England
OL,14,Fand Northern Ireland, where a yellow
OL,15,Fwarning is in place from 10:00
OL,17,FGusts are forecast to reach 60-70mph
OL,18,Fwidely and could reach 80mph in exposed
OL,19,Flocations
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
