OL,3,AStorm Boelo expected to bring more
OL,4,Adisruption as hundreds still hit by
OL,5,AAusten power cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FPoor travelling conditions are expected
OL,8,Facross the UK, while the weather could
OL,9,Falso cause power cuts and property
OL,10,Fdamage
OL,12,FThe new storm is hot on the heels of
OL,13,FStorm Austen, the first named storm of
OL,14,Fthe season, which mainly affected
OL,15,Fsouth-west England during Friday
OL,16,Fmorning
